      "widgets_values": [
        "## Flux landscape 1280\u00d7720 (lab)\n\nWhat this graph does: Widescreen landscape text\u2192image at 1280\u00d7720.\nModels: flux-2-klein-9b-nvfp4 + qwen_3_8b_fp4mixed (CLIP type flux2) + flux2-vae.\nSampler: euler \u00b7 simple \u00b7 CFG 1.0 \u00b7 8 steps \u00b7 1280\u00d7720 \u00b7 batch 1.\nSaveImage prefix: ez_flux_landscape.\n\nPrompting (Flux.2 Klein + Qwen3 TE):\n\u2022 Write natural-language prose, not SD tag soup. Subject first, then place, materials, lighting, camera.\n\u2022 Prefer positive constraints (\u201csharp focus\u201d, \u201cempty street\u201d, \u201cseamless white\u201d) over \u201cno X\u201d.\n\u2022 Comfy (weight:1.4) emphasis is not applied by this text encoder.\n\u2022 At CFG 1.0 the Negative node is largely inert; quality is almost entirely the Positive prompt.\n\nHow to run:\n1. Review Positive prompt; queue."
      ],
